{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Each man to his holding</b> — and adjacent to it: \"when you sell a sale to your fellow\" — i.e., assets that have no guaranty are acquired together with assets that have guaranty. And further, it is juxtaposed to \"do not wrong one another, each man to his holding\" — i.e., even land has onward (deception), up to the amount of its value."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:30.144672409Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}